  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Card Casting drawback (Mana Pool), any metamagic feat</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> For the purpose of your Mana Pool drawback, spell points spent on metamagic feats are not counted when determining the number of Mana Point cards you need to cast a card (or to discard, if you have the Mana Graveyard drawback). Additionally, reduce the spell point cost increase of all metamagic feats used in conjunction with the Card Casting drawback by 1 (minimum 1).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/card-and-deck-feats#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
